\loch\af2\dbch\af2\hich\f2\strike0\ulnone\cf2 All bus drivers want is to be treated fairly, and they have had enough. That's why on Monday they're taking industrial action to turn off their Opal machines, carrying passengers for free so Transit Systems can't profit.}
