\loch\af2\dbch\af2\hich\f2\strike0\ulnone\cf2 I think it had a big impact, not just in terms of job losses, but it also had what Patrick McGorry has termed an impact on people's wellbeing, so as not just about preventing Covid and the illness and is we should also be focused on people's general wellbeing as well.}
